(DIXIT - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Dixit is a storytelling game with 84 illustrated cards. One player is the storyteller) Tj T*
(each round. The goal is to give clues that are neither too obvious nor too obscure.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Each player takes a voting set and a rabbit on the score track. Deal 6 cards to each) Tj T*
(player. With 3 players, deal 7 cards each.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A ROUND) Tj T*
(1. The storyteller secretly picks a card from their hand and says a clue: a word, a) Tj T*
(   sentence,) Tj T*
(   a sound or a song. They place the card face down.) Tj T*
(2. Every other player picks the card from their hand that best fits the clue and gives) Tj T*
(   it to the) Tj T*
(   storyteller face down. With 3 players, each other player gives 2 cards.) Tj T*
(3. The storyteller shuffles the cards and lays them face up in a row.) Tj T*
(4. The other players secretly vote for the card they think belongs to the storyteller.) Tj T*
(   You may not vote for your own card. The storyteller does not vote.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
