(SCORING) Tj T*
(- If all players, or no player, found the storyteller's card: the storyteller scores 0) Tj T*
(   and every) Tj T*
(other player scores 2 points.) Tj T*
(- Otherwise: the storyteller and each player who found the card score 3 points.) Tj T*
(- Every player except the storyteller scores 1 point for each vote their own card) Tj T*
(   received.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(END OF THE ROUND) Tj T*
(Everyone draws back up to 6 cards. The next player clockwise becomes the storyteller.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(END OF THE GAME) Tj T*
(The game ends when the draw pile is empty, or when a player reaches 30 points. The) Tj T*
(player with the most points wins.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(TIP) Tj T*
(A good clue is found by some players, not by all of them. Vague clues let other) Tj T*
(players bluff with their own cards and earn bonus points.) Tj T*
ET
